    "cnf": "(forall ?phone (exists ?bowl (exists ?lighter (and (or (not (Is ?phone 'phone')) (Is ?bowl 'bowl')) (or (not (Is ?phone 'phone')) (RightOf ?phone ?bowl)) (or (not (Is ?phone 'phone')) (Is ?lighter 'lighter')) (or (not (Is ?phone 'phone')) (LargerThan ?bowl ?phone)) (or (not (Is ?phone 'phone')) (RightOf ?lighter ?phone)) (or (not (Is ?phone 'phone')) (SmallerThan ?lighter ?phone)) (or (not (Is ?phone 'phone')) (OnRightSide ?lighter))))))",
    "k": 3,
    "object_classes": [
        "bowl",
        "phone",
        "lighter"
    ]
}